#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"**AgentSociety 2** 是面向计算社会科学的现代化、LLM 原生智能体模拟与科研平台：在统一的异步框架中创建与管理智能体、环境模块与研究技能，并支持从 "
"CLI、REST API 到集成研究环境的多入口协作。"
msgstr ""
"**AgentSociety 2** is a modern, LLM-native agent simulation and research-"
"orchestration platform for computational social science. It provides a unified async "
"framework for agents, environment modules, and research skills, with multiple entry "
"points from the CLI and REST API to integrated research environments."

