#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/index.rst:36
msgid "研究工作区"
msgstr "Research workspace"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"平台把两类智能体放进同一个研究工作区：AI Social Scientist "
"协调文献、假设、实验和分析，硅基参与者在可配置环境中产生行为反馈。研究者负责明确问题、审阅设计并判断证据能支持哪些结论。"
msgstr ""
"Two agent roles share one workspace: the AI Social Scientist coordinates literature, "
"hypotheses, experiments and analysis; Silicon Participants produce behavioral data in"
" configurable environments. Researchers define the question, review designs and "
"interpret the evidence."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"工作从 ``TOPIC.md`` 开始，逐步形成假设、可执行配置、运行记录和报告。CLI、Python API 与工作台共享核心仿真能力；运行架构见 "
":doc:`architecture`，智能体与技能见 :doc:`agents`、:doc:`agent_skills`。论文撰写通过外部 ``paper-"
"toolkit`` 接续分析结果。"
msgstr ""
"Work starts in ``TOPIC.md`` and produces hypotheses, executable configurations, run "
"records and reports. The CLI, Python API and workbench share core simulation "
"capabilities. See :doc:`architecture` for runtime details and :doc:`agents` / "
":doc:`agent_skills` for agents and skills. External ``paper-toolkit`` continues from "
"analysis outputs to manuscript writing."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/index.rst:42
msgid "完整步骤见 :doc:`research_workflow`；准备输入数据见 :doc:`datasets`；查看回放与研究产物见 :doc:`results`。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`research_workflow` for the complete process, :doc:`datasets` for input data"
" preparation, and :doc:`results` for replay and research artifacts."

